<h2 id="rubric">The rubric, mapped</h2>
<p>The sponsor awards diversity points for each distinct technique a system actually uses, plus a bonus for choosing analyses per file. {{src:README.md#the-eight-forensic-techniques|Source: the README's technique table.}}</p>
