<tr><td>Spectral / frequency-domain analysis</td><td><a href="#handcrafted">handcrafted</a>, <a href="#spectra">Spectra-AASIST</a></td><td>fused ({{num:20%|README.md#the-eight-forensic-techniques}}); suppressor</td></tr>
